p2pKanban packaging notice

This repository snapshot does not yet declare a public redistribution license for
p2pKanban. The Arch package/repository machinery in A15 is intended for
project-controlled evaluation and distribution by the rights holder.

Do not publish this package to the AUR or a public mirror until the project owner
supplies and approves the software license. Package signatures and repository
metadata authenticate artifacts; they do not grant redistribution rights.
